## About features
zk.about.featuresTitle=§eFeatures
zk.about.features.start=§aSTART SCREEN
zk.about.features.settings=§6SETTINGS
zk.about.features.dialogs=§dINTERFACE AND DIALOGS
zk.about.features.game=§cIN GAME
zk.about.features.sound=§9SOUND AND LANGUAGES
zk.about.featuresLabel1=- Centered layout with quick access to Play, Servers, and Marketplace.
zk.about.featuresLabel2=- Side menu with shortcuts to profile, inbox, achievements, and Realms.
zk.about.featuresLabel3=- Option to hide the interface and view the panorama.
zk.about.featuresLabel4=- Screens reorganized in the Ore UI visual style, with option search.
zk.about.featuresLabel5=- Storage management and detailed information for each pack.
zk.about.featuresLabel6=- Confirmation and loading windows with a modern look.
zk.about.featuresLabel7=- Red highlight for irreversible actions, such as deletions.
zk.about.featuresLabel8=- Custom click sound on buttons and toggles.
zk.about.featuresLabel9=- Texts available in English and Portuguese (Brazil).
zk.about.featuresLabel10=- Pause screen with shortcuts, quit confirmation, and an option to hide the interface.
zk.about.featuresLabel11=- Loading screen with percentage, animation, and a notice for stuck loading on servers.
zk.about.featuresLabel12=- Inventory and crafting table with the vanilla look and extra tools.
zk.about.featuresLabel13=- Item modes: Normal, Quick Move, Drop, and Destroy (Creative only), with an x64 or x1 amount.
zk.about.featuresLabel14=- Chests, ender chests, shulker boxes, barrels, copper chests, hoppers, droppers, and dispensers with the same item modes.
zk.about.featuresLabel15=- Buttons to move everything between your inventory and storage containers in one click.

